COMPILATION OF: E46M8

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M8

   1 a 0000 E46M8:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] TWO CHARACTER FIXED scalars, both routes. Each item
   4 a 0006      carries its OWN declared length inline (0E and 0A), so the two
   5 a 0006      chains differ by one byte and a shared or hoisted width operand
   6 a 0006      would show immediately. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, c char(14), d char(10);
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M8OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list(c,d);
  10 c 0048   put list(c,d);
  11 c 006A   close file(outf);
  12 a 0070 end E46M8;

CODE SIZE = 0073
DATA AREA = 0021
FREE SYMS = 389D
END  COMPILATION
